{"ref":"BDB, עָגִיל","hw":"עָגִיל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָגִיל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>hoop, ring</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:50\" href=\"/Numbers.31.50\">Nu 31:50</a> prob. <em>ear-ring</em> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">טַבַּעַת</span>, etc.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲגִילִים עַל־ אָזְנָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.12\">Ez 16:12</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶזֶם עַל־אַפֵּךְ</span> <em>nose-ring</em>).","next":"BDB, עֶגְלוֹן","prev":"BDB, עֲגָלָה"}